# Grid carbon intensity for bldg1, as the ontosage:gridCarbonIntensity property (2026-11-07).
#
# The building already declared its factor -- 233 gCO2/kWh, "UK 2024 average", in
# bldg1_enhancements.ttl -- but under a property of its own namespace
# (bldg:carbonIntensityGCO2perKWh), which no building-agnostic code may read. This file states
# the SAME value under the schema's property so "what was the carbon footprint of the electricity
# used last month?" can be computed (electricity total x factor) in any building that declares
# one. The value is the building's, unchanged; it is not re-derived here.

@prefix bldg:     <http://abacwsbuilding.cardiff.ac.uk/abacws#> .
@prefix ontosage: <http://ontosage.org/capabilities#> .
@prefix xsd:      <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

bldg:Abacws
    ontosage:gridCarbonIntensity "233.0"^^xsd:decimal ;
    ontosage:gridCarbonIntensitySource "the building's EPC record (UK grid average, 2024, as stated there)" .
